{
  "spec": {
    "title": "CSS Scroll Anchoring Module Level 1",
    "url": "https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-anchoring-1/"
  },
  "algorithms": [
    {
      "name": "anchor node selection algorithm",
      "href": "https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-anchoring-1/#anchoring-algorithm",
      "html": "The <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled\" data-dfn-type=\"dfn\" data-noexport=\"\" id=\"anchoring-algorithm\"><button class=\"dfn-panelbutton\" popovertarget=\"infopanel-for-anchoring-algorithm\">anchor node selection algorithm</button></dfn><dialog class=\"dfn-panel\" id=\"infopanel-for-anchoring-algorithm\" popover=\"hint\" data-for=\"anchoring-algorithm\" aria-labelledby=\"infopaneltitle-for-anchoring-algorithm\"><span id=\"infopaneltitle-for-anchoring-algorithm\" style=\"display:none\">Info about the 'anchor node selection algorithm'  reference.</span><a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-anchoring-1/#anchoring-algorithm\" class=\"dfn-link\">#anchoring-algorithm</a><b>Referenced in:</b><ul><li><a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-anchoring-1/#ref-for-anchoring-algorithm\">2.1.1. Invalidation</a> </li><li><a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-anchoring-1/#ref-for-anchoring-algorithm%E2%91%A0\">3. Exclusion API</a> <a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-anchoring-1/#ref-for-anchoring-algorithm%E2%91%A1\">(2)</a> </li></ul><b>Possible linking syntaxes:</b><ul><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=anchor node selection algorithm=]</span></div></li><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=/anchor node selection algorithm=]</span></div></li></ul></dialog>\n\tfor a scrolling box <var>S</var> is as follows:",
      "rationale": ".algorithm",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "<p>If <var>S</var> is generated by an element\nwhose computed value of the <a class=\"css property\" data-link-type=\"property\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-anchoring-1/#propdef-overflow-anchor\" id=\"ref-for-propdef-overflow-anchor\">overflow-anchor</a> property is <a class=\"css\" data-link-type=\"maybe\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-anchoring-1/#valdef-overflow-anchor-none\" id=\"ref-for-valdef-overflow-anchor-none\">none</a>,\nthen do not select an anchor node for <var>S</var>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>If <var>S</var> is not scrolled away from the origin of its <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom-view-1/#scrolling-area\" id=\"ref-for-scrolling-area\">scrolling area</a> in its\n<a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-writing-modes-4/#block-flow-direction\" id=\"ref-for-block-flow-direction\">block flow direction</a>, then do not select an anchor node for <var>S</var>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Otherwise, for each <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-anchoring-1/#anchor-priority-candidates\" id=\"ref-for-anchor-priority-candidates①\">priority candidate</a> <var>PC</var> in order specified,\ncheck if <var>PC</var> is a <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-anchoring-1/#anchor-viable-candidate\" id=\"ref-for-anchor-viable-candidate\">viable candidate</a> in <var>S</var>.\nIf so, perform the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-anchoring-1/#candidate-examination\" id=\"ref-for-candidate-examination\">candidate examination algorithm</a> for <var>PC</var> in <var>S</var> and terminate.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Otherwise, for each DOM child <var>N</var> of the element or document associated with <var>S</var>,\nperform the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-anchoring-1/#candidate-examination\" id=\"ref-for-candidate-examination②\">candidate examination algorithm</a> for <var>N</var> in <var>S</var>,\nand terminate if it selects an anchor node.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "candidate examination algorithm",
      "href": "https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-anchoring-1/#candidate-examination",
      "html": "The <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled\" data-dfn-type=\"dfn\" data-noexport=\"\" id=\"candidate-examination\"><button class=\"dfn-panelbutton\" popovertarget=\"infopanel-for-candidate-examination\">candidate examination algorithm</button></dfn><dialog class=\"dfn-panel\" id=\"infopanel-for-candidate-examination\" popover=\"hint\" data-for=\"candidate-examination\" aria-labelledby=\"infopaneltitle-for-candidate-examination\"><span id=\"infopaneltitle-for-candidate-examination\" style=\"display:none\">Info about the 'candidate examination algorithm'  reference.</span><a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-anchoring-1/#candidate-examination\" class=\"dfn-link\">#candidate-examination</a><b>Referenced in:</b><ul><li><a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-anchoring-1/#ref-for-candidate-examination\">2.1. Anchor Node Selection</a> <a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-anchoring-1/#ref-for-candidate-examination%E2%91%A0\">(2)</a> <a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-anchoring-1/#ref-for-candidate-examination%E2%91%A1\">(3)</a> <a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-anchoring-1/#ref-for-candidate-examination%E2%91%A2\">(4)</a> <a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-anchoring-1/#ref-for-candidate-examination%E2%91%A3\">(5)</a> </li><li><a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-anchoring-1/#ref-for-candidate-examination%E2%91%A4\">Changes Since the Feb 11 2020 Working Draft</a> </li></ul><b>Possible linking syntaxes:</b><ul><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=candidate examination algorithm=]</span></div></li><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=/candidate examination algorithm=]</span></div></li></ul></dialog>\n\tfor a candidate DOM node <var>N</var> in a scrolling box <var>S</var> is as follows:",
      "rationale": ".algorithm",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "<p>If <var>N</var> is an <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-anchoring-1/#excluded-subtree\" id=\"ref-for-excluded-subtree②\">excluded subtree</a>,\nor if <var>N</var> is <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-anchoring-1/#fully-clipped\" id=\"ref-for-fully-clipped\">fully clipped</a> in <var>S</var>,\nthen do nothing (<var>N</var> and its descendants are skipped).</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>If <var>N</var> is <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-anchoring-1/#fully-visible\" id=\"ref-for-fully-visible①\">fully visible</a> in <var>S</var>,\nselect <var>N</var> as the anchor node.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "If N is <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-anchoring-1/#partially-visible\" id=\"ref-for-partially-visible①\">partially visible</a>:",
          "rationale": "for",
          "steps": [
            {
              "html": "<p>For each DOM child <var>C</var> of <var>N</var>,\nperform the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-anchoring-1/#candidate-examination\" id=\"ref-for-candidate-examination③\">candidate examination algorithm</a> for <var>C</var> in <var>S</var>,\nand terminate if it selects an anchor node.</p>"
            },
            {
              "html": "<p>For each absolutely-positioned element <var>A</var>\nwhose <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-display-4/#containing-block\" id=\"ref-for-containing-block\">containing block</a> is <var>N</var>,\nbut whose DOM parent is not <var>N</var>,\nperform the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-anchoring-1/#candidate-examination\" id=\"ref-for-candidate-examination④\">candidate examination algorithm</a> for <var>A</var> in <var>S</var>,\nand terminate if it selects an anchor node.</p>"
            },
            {
              "html": "<p>Select <var>N</var> as the anchor node.\n(If this step is reached,\nno suitable anchor node was found among <var>N</var>’s descendants.)</p>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}